// COMPILER-QUERY evidence: the subject is compiler state or a compiler qualification product
// (declaration index, resolver bindings, compile diagnostics, policy brackets). The seed host
// producer is named per row; the derivation admits CompilerQueryFrontier only when the census
// join finds a seed-growth row owning that producer, else SeedGrowthOwnershipAbsent. The two
// rows this census adds (builtin_function_registry_keys, compile_dag_primitive_call_edges) sit
// in their own denominator with the same option-A trigger as their precedent in
// gunbc.evaluation_store_address_census_seed_growth.
